-You know what?

00:06:29.788 --> 00:06:32.291
People have got to be better
with the summer money out there.

00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:33.759
-Yeah.
-Hold on a second. Wait.

00:06:33.759 --> 00:06:35.928
-Yep.
[ Alarm chirps ]

00:06:35.928 --> 00:06:38.197
-Had to unlock my Jet Ski.
-Yeah.

00:06:38.197 --> 00:06:40.333
Appreciate it.

00:06:42.167 --> 00:06:43.703
